@display("std/json")
json: feature {
  | JSON as an embedded language and as an encoding code reads and writes.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/json/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export                       | Specified in                                                                                                |
  | | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
  | | `json`                       | [Typed strings](#language.data.typed_strings)                                                               |
  | | `decode`, `encode`           | [JSON](#language.data.encodings.json)                                                                       |
  | | `@key`, `@keys`, `Case`      | [JSON](#language.data.encodings.json.json_names), [JSON-RPC](#language.apis.jsonrpc.params.wire_names)       |
  | | `DecodeError`, `EncodeError` | [JSON](#language.data.encodings.json), [declared errors](#language.scripting.code.failures.declared_errors) |
}
